OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FNo rain is
OL,6,Fexpected overnight but clear periods
OL,7,Fin the evening will decrease as
OL,8,Fthickening cloud spreads east from
OL,9,Fmidnight. Winds light and variable in
OL,10,Fdirection.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FSome early brightness in
OL,13,Feast and central areas. Otherwise
OL,14,Frather cloudy with patchy rain in
OL,15,Fwestern Central and Tayside, which
OL,16,Fextends across the rest of the region
OL,17,Fduring the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
